From: NikSun <candysfm@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 15:34:55 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] feat(ble): cancel the active PassVoice capture

Negotiate cancellation with the host and transmit a session-scoped terminal
event for an OK hold inside an active capture.
---
