 docs/CHANGELOG.zh_CN.md                |  2 ++
 docs/ai-passport-ble-protocol.md       | 14 +++++++--
 docs/ai-passport-ble-protocol.zh_CN.md | 13 ++++++--
 main/button_gesture.h                  | 16 ++++++++--
 main/vokie_ble.c                       | 55 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++----
